{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_ottimasystem_docsv1_1_adr_adr_009_watchdog_bit_alternante", "label": "ADR-009 \u2014 Watchdog de comunica\u00e7\u00e3o por bit alternante (NOT cruzado)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/ottimasystem-docsv1.1/adr/ADR-009-watchdog-bit-alternante.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_ottimasystem_docsv1_1_adr_adr_009_watchdog_bit_alternante_watchdog_bit", "label": "Watchdog por bit alternante (NOT cruzado)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ottimasystem-docsv1.1/adr/ADR-009-watchdog-bit-alternante.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Duas vari\u00e1veis OPC por PLC; cada lado l\u00ea o bit do outro, aplica NOT e escreve de volta \u2014 bit alterna 0\u21941 continuamente. Se parar de variar por >10 s, comunica\u00e7\u00e3o declarada em falha: sistema para de escrever MVs e o flow para; o PLC retoma controle convencional. Detec\u00e7\u00e3o sim\u00e9trica independente de status de sess\u00e3o; trivial de implementar em qualquer PLC (uma rung). Configurado por conex\u00e3o OPC, n\u00e3o por flow."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_ottimasystem_docsv1_1_adr_adr_009_watchdog_bit_alternante", "target": "docs_ottimasystem_docsv1_1_adr_adr_009_watchdog_bit_alternante_watchdog_bit", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/ottimasystem-docsv1.1/adr/ADR-009-watchdog-bit-alternante.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_ottimasystem_docsv1_1_adr_adr_009_watchdog_bit_alternante_watchdog_bit", "target": "docs_ottimasystem_docsv1_1_adr_adr_006_separacao_opc_worker_flow_runtime_opc_worker", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "docs/ottimasystem-docsv1.1/adr/ADR-009-watchdog-bit-alternante.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}],